 of its own, written as [Write bindings](../interop/bindings.md) says, and
 shared as an npm package ([ADR 0118](../../decisions/0118-bindings-on-npm-only.md)).
 A crate from crates.io is [Crates from crates.io](crates-io.md).
+
+### Typed canvas contexts
+
+Use canvas.get_context(webapi::canvas_contexts::TwoD, None) to request a nullable
+CanvasRenderingContext2D directly. BitmapRenderer, WebGl, WebGl2 and WebGpu tokens
+likewise carry the browser's request/result relationship. Dynamic string names
+use the same method and retain its broad RenderingContext result. No instanceof
+check or application-side cast is needed. See [the decision](../../decisions/1137-typed-canvas-context-requests.md).
